<resources>
    <!--
        The launcher icon for the 43mm device.

        Launcher icon size is a device property, not a resolution one: the 454
        devices ask for 65x65 and `fenix843mm` asks for 60x60. Shipping only the
        65 made the build scale it down and warn, which is a resample of a
        resample once the disc's antialiased edge is involved.

        Same id as the base resource, so this overrides it on the device whose
        resource path includes this directory. Regenerate both together with
        tools/icongen/launchergen.js — the ratio between the letter and the disc
        is what keeps them looking like one icon, and it does not survive being
        rescaled by hand.
    -->
    <bitmap id="LauncherIcon" filename="launcher_icon.png" />
</resources>
